s=s.replace("setInterval(updateClockAndBoost,1000);render();", "$('buildingImage').src=sequenceUrls[0];startBackgroundSequence();setInterval(updateClockAndBoost,1000);render();")

# Resolve room lights range input while control isn't rerendered on each input (show percentage via CSS? set local counter in header)
